{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-49187","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55554","text":"Skill 04 — Autonomy Levels"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49189","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55555","text":"Graduated autonomy: observe, advise, act. Trust-building workflows, enforcement mechanics, and when to use each level."}]}],"id":"blk-49188","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-49190","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55556","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49191","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55557","text":"Why This Matters"}]},{"id":"blk-49192","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55558","text":"Autonomy levels solve the trust problem in agent deployment. You do not want a newly installed agent executing actions unsupervised. You also do not want a proven agent waiting for human approval on every routine task. Graduated autonomy provides the middle ground — a progression from observation to full autonomy, with audit at every step."}]},{"id":"blk-49193","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55559","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49194","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55560","text":"The Three Levels"}]},{"id":"blk-49195","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55561","text":"Observe"}]},{"id":"blk-49196","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55562","text":"The agent generates recommendations but takes no action."}]},{"id":"blk-49197","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55563","text":"All proposed actions are logged to the audit trail as "},{"id":"spn-55564","marks":["code"],"text":"action_recommended"}]}],"id":"blk-49198","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49201","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55565","text":"No side effects are produced"}]}],"id":"blk-49200","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49203","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55566","text":"The operator reviews recommendations and manually executes if appropriate"}]}],"id":"blk-49202","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55567","text":"Useful for: new agents, untrusted agents, sensitive domains"}]}],"id":"blk-49204","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49206","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55568","marks":["bold"],"text":"Enforcement:"},{"id":"spn-55569","text":" The AutonomyController intercepts the action dispatch and replaces execution with a recommendation log entry."}]},{"id":"blk-49207","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55570","text":"Advise"}]},{"id":"blk-49208","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55571","text":"The agent prepares actions and queues them for human approval."}]},{"id":"blk-49209","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49211","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55572","text":"Proposed actions are placed in an approval queue"}]}],"id":"blk-49210","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49213","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55573","text":"The operator receives a notification (via MCP or PubSub)"}]}],"id":"blk-49212","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49215","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55574","text":"The operator approves or rejects each queued action"}]}],"id":"blk-49214","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49217","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55575","text":"Approved actions execute with full permission checking"}]}],"id":"blk-49216","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49219","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55576","text":"Rejected actions are logged as "},{"id":"spn-55577","marks":["code"],"text":"action_blocked"},{"id":"spn-55578","text":" with the rejection reason"}]}],"id":"blk-49218","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55579","marks":["bold"],"text":"Enforcement:"},{"id":"spn-55580","text":" The AutonomyController holds the action in a GenServer queue. A separate approval interface (MCP tool or Elixir API) resolves the queue."}]},{"id":"blk-49221","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55581","text":"Act"}]},{"id":"blk-49222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55582","text":"The agent executes autonomously within its granted permissions."}]},{"id":"blk-49223","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49225","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55583","text":"Actions proceed directly to the PermissionEngine for checking"}]}],"id":"blk-49224","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49227","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55584","text":"Permitted actions execute immediately"}]}],"id":"blk-49226","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49229","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55585","text":"Denied actions are blocked and logged as "},{"id":"spn-55586","marks":["code"],"text":"action_blocked"}]}],"id":"blk-49228","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49231","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55587","text":"No human approval step"}]}],"id":"blk-49230","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49233","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55588","text":"All actions are still audited as "},{"id":"spn-55589","marks":["code"],"text":"action_executed"}]}],"id":"blk-49232","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49234","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55590","marks":["bold"],"text":"Enforcement:"},{"id":"spn-55591","text":" The AutonomyController forwards the action directly to the PermissionEngine. No queuing or interception."}]},{"id":"blk-49235","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55592","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49236","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55593","text":"Trust-Building Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-49237","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55594","text":"The recommended progression for any new agent:"}]},{"id":"blk-49238","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Install at observe (default)\n   --> Review audit trail for 1-2 sessions\n   --> Verify recommendations are sensible\n\n2. Promote to advise\n   --> Review and approve queued actions\n   --> Build confidence in the agent's judgment\n   --> Track approval/rejection ratio\n\n3. Promote to act (when ready)\n   --> Agent operates autonomously within permissions\n   --> Continue monitoring audit trail\n   --> Demote immediately if behavior degrades"},{"id":"blk-49239","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55595","text":"This progression is not mandatory. An operator who trusts the agent's provenance (e.g., a well-tested internal tool) can skip directly to "},{"id":"spn-55596","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-55597","text":". But the audit trail always records the autonomy level at every action."}]},{"id":"blk-49240","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55598","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49241","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55599","text":"autonomy_level Tool"}]},{"id":"blk-49242","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55600","text":"Get Current Level"}]},{"id":"blk-49243","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"autonomy_level(agent_id: \"my-worker\")\n# => {ok, \"observe\"}"},{"id":"blk-49244","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55601","text":"Set Level"}]},{"id":"blk-49245","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"autonomy_level(agent_id: \"my-worker\", level: \"advise\")\n# => {ok, \"autonomy changed: observe -> advise\"}"},{"id":"blk-49246","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55602","text":"Parameters"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-49248","spans":[{"id":"spn-55603","text":"Param"}]},{"id":"blk-49249","spans":[{"id":"spn-55604","text":"Required"}]},{"id":"blk-49250","spans":[{"id":"spn-55605","text":"Type"}]},{"id":"blk-49251","spans":[{"id":"spn-55606","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-49247","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-49252","spans":[{"id":"spn-55607","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_id"}]},{"id":"blk-49253","spans":[{"id":"spn-55608","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-49254","spans":[{"id":"spn-55609","text":"string"}]},{"id":"blk-49255","spans":[{"id":"spn-55610","text":"The agent to query or update"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49256","spans":[{"id":"spn-55611","marks":["code"],"text":"level"}]},{"id":"blk-49257","spans":[{"id":"spn-55612","text":"No"}]},{"id":"blk-49258","spans":[{"id":"spn-55613","text":"string"}]},{"id":"blk-49259","spans":[{"id":"spn-55614","text":"New level: "},{"id":"spn-55615","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-55616","text":", "},{"id":"spn-55617","marks":["code"],"text":"advise"},{"id":"spn-55618","text":", or "},{"id":"spn-55619","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-55620","text":". Omit to query."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-49260","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55621","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49261","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55622","text":"Enforcement Mechanics"}]},{"id":"blk-49262","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55623","text":"Observe Mode — Intercept and Recommend"}]},{"id":"blk-49263","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Agent proposes action\n  --> AutonomyController checks level = observe\n  --> Action is NOT executed\n  --> AuditWriter logs: event_type=action_recommended, operation=<action details>\n  --> Agent receives: {blocked, \"autonomy: observe — action logged as recommendation\"}"},{"id":"blk-49264","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55624","text":"Advise Mode — Queue and Await Approval"}]},{"id":"blk-49265","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Agent proposes action\n  --> AutonomyController checks level = advise\n  --> Action is queued in GenServer state\n  --> Notification sent via PubSub\n  --> Operator approves/rejects via MCP or API\n  --> Approved: PermissionEngine.check() --> execute or block\n  --> Rejected: AuditWriter logs action_blocked with rejection reason"},{"id":"blk-49266","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55625","text":"Act Mode — Forward to Permissions"}]},{"id":"blk-49267","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Agent proposes action\n  --> AutonomyController checks level = act\n  --> PermissionEngine.check(agent_id, type, access, resource)\n  --> allow: execute action, log action_executed\n  --> deny: block action, log action_blocked"},{"id":"blk-49268","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55626","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49269","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55627","text":"When to Use Each Level"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-49271","spans":[{"id":"spn-55628","text":"Scenario"}]},{"id":"blk-49272","spans":[{"id":"spn-55629","text":"Recommended Level"}]},{"id":"blk-49273","spans":[{"id":"spn-55630","text":"Reason"}]}],"id":"blk-49270","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-49274","spans":[{"id":"spn-55631","text":"Agent just installed, source unknown"}]},{"id":"blk-49275","spans":[{"id":"spn-55632","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"}]},{"id":"blk-49276","spans":[{"id":"spn-55633","text":"Build trust before granting power"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49277","spans":[{"id":"spn-55634","text":"Agent from FleetPrompt marketplace"}]},{"id":"blk-49278","spans":[{"id":"spn-55635","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"}]},{"id":"blk-49279","spans":[{"id":"spn-55636","text":"Third-party code needs vetting"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49280","spans":[{"id":"spn-55637","text":"Internal tool, well-tested"}]},{"id":"blk-49281","spans":[{"id":"spn-55638","marks":["code"],"text":"advise"},{"id":"spn-55639","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-55640","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-49282","spans":[{"id":"spn-55641","text":"Known provenance reduces risk"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49283","spans":[{"id":"spn-55642","text":"Agent operating in production"}]},{"id":"blk-49284","spans":[{"id":"spn-55643","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-49285","spans":[{"id":"spn-55644","text":"Approval latency is unacceptable"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49286","spans":[{"id":"spn-55645","text":"Agent accessing sensitive data"}]},{"id":"blk-49287","spans":[{"id":"spn-55646","marks":["code"],"text":"advise"}]},{"id":"blk-49288","spans":[{"id":"spn-55647","text":"Human oversight for high-stakes operations"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49289","spans":[{"id":"spn-55648","text":"Debugging or investigating behavior"}]},{"id":"blk-49290","spans":[{"id":"spn-55649","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"}]},{"id":"blk-49291","spans":[{"id":"spn-55650","text":"See what the agent would do without consequences"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-49292","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55651","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49293","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55652","text":"Audit Trail for Autonomy Changes"}]},{"id":"blk-49294","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55653","text":"Every autonomy level change is recorded:"}]},{"id":"blk-49295","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"aud_...\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T10:35:00Z\",\n  \"agent_id\": \"my-worker\",\n  \"event_type\": \"autonomy_change\",\n  \"operation\": \"observe -> advise\",\n  \"result\": \"ok\",\n  \"actor\": \"operator\",\n  \"reason\": \"Agent demonstrated consistent recommendations over 3 sessions\",\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"previous_level\": \"observe\",\n    \"new_level\": \"advise\",\n    \"sessions_at_previous_level\": 3\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-49296","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55654","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-49297","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55655","text":"Demotion"}]},{"id":"blk-49298","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55656","text":"Autonomy demotion is always available and immediate. If an agent at "},{"id":"spn-55657","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-55658","text":" level produces unexpected behavior, the operator can demote to "},{"id":"spn-55659","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-55660","text":" instantly:"}]},{"id":"blk-49299","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"autonomy_level(agent_id: \"my-worker\", level: \"observe\")"},{"id":"blk-49300","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55661","text":"The agent's next action will be intercepted and logged as a recommendation instead of executed. No restart is required."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierah5mdq67uf3tyvrzfmxdjdmxmu5d2b45rwt2hyxkeencbve4i4exq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}